@Content_HostAddress = http://localhost:5006

### Learner list (published exams only)
GET {{Content_HostAddress}}/api/exams?pageIndex=1&pageSize=8
Accept: application/json

### Search and filter
GET {{Content_HostAddress}}/api/exams?search=TOEIC&year=2024&pageIndex=1&pageSize=8
Accept: application/json

### Learner detail (no answers)
GET {{Content_HostAddress}}/api/exams/1
Accept: application/json

### CMS routes remain separate
GET {{Content_HostAddress}}/api/cms/exams
Accept: application/json
